# Dockerignore for the commit-image build (mayhem/Dockerfile). BuildKit prefers
# this over the repo-root .dockerignore, whose upstream rules exclude .git,
# .github, docs and *.md/*.txt — all of which the commit image MUST bake in
# (the grader uses .git; the test suite reads testdata *.txt files).
# Drop only local build artifacts and editor/OS cruft.
mayhem-build/
*.o
*.a
*.so
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
